The colorcenters plugin ports the NV and SnV colour-centre model of
Diamond-color-centers-emulation-on-NetSquid
(https://github.com/rodrigt11/Diamond-color-centers-emulation-on-NetSquid),
by the COMPUTAEX authors: its processor definitions, gate primitives,
entanglement model and 2026 parameter sets (NVParameterSet2026COMPUTAEX,
SnVParameterSet2026COMPUTAEX), rebuilt on SquidASM.
